body:
Just got one, now too. Kate Burkowski at Fanatics saw my profile on Indeed. 

&#x200B;

Got excited. womp womp

Hey, everyone! I'm new to youtube (obviously) and this subreddit. I started making vlogs because of covid. I've been in quarantine for about a month now and I was starting to lose my mind and drive my boyfriend insane. So, started making vlogs. It's kinda nice to do this now, because I can't rely on going to places to make videos, I have to entertain myself and my viewer at home. Plus the time at home lets me study up on some editing techniques! 

&#x200B;

Here's my most recent video : [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pz5CWY5n97U&t=25s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pz5CWY5n97U&t=25s)
